<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 120 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$68.50	  PREMIUM	  13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.9453	 GEARING	  7.25X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  3.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   5.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$68.50	  MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLARS OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
